</span><span id="id2" class="ltx_note ltx_note_frontmatter ltx_thanks_note ltx_role_thanks"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_type">thanks: </span>Munich RE; e-mail: <span id="id2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">yli@munichre.com</span></span></span></span></span>
